### 3. Join Meeting

```cpp
#include <meeting_service_interface.h>
#include "MeetingServiceEventListener.h"

IMeetingService* meetingService = nullptr;

void OnMeetingJoined() {
    std::cout << "Joining meeting..." << std::endl;
}

